<title>PHILIPPINES: Manila's PHIBOR market closed for Independence Day.</title>
<headline>Manila's PHIBOR market closed for Independence Day.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippine interbank offered rates (PHIBOR) market is closed on Thursday as the nation marks its Independence Day.</p>
<p>On Wednesday, short-term PHIBOR dipped slightly, while the long end of the curve remained unchanged.</p>
<p>Trading will resume on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Manila Newsroom (63 2) 841-8938 Fax 817-6267</p>
</text>
